**Quarter:** 1  
**Week:** 3  
**Dates:** September 7–11, 2026  
**Quarter Theme:** Foundations  
**Academic Focus:** Numbers & Operations  
**Recurring Routine:** Learn → Practice → Check → Analyze → Retry → Apply

> **Calendar Note:** Monday, September 7, 2026 is Labor Day. This is a shortened instructional week. The sequence below assumes four instructional days.

